  "description": "ROM catalogue (GRAF_HUB_KOD_SILNIK section 3): the 13 read-only items shipped with the program, generated by tools/gen_rom_catalogue.py from the working tree. Do not edit by hand. status: present = files found and no known gap; partial = files found with a stated gap; missing = nothing implements it. A user may override an item in the writable memory through the graph_entry overlay (rom.items.<id>); the ROM itself is never written.",
